+###########################################################
+#
+# Copyright (c) 2005, Southpaw Technology
+#                     All Rights Reserved
+#
+# PROPRIETARY INFORMATION.  This software is proprietary to
+# Southpaw Technology, and is not to be reproduced, transmitted,
